ddressbook><name>YAMADA TSUTOMU</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>HITACHI, LTD.</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KUROSAWA, KENICHI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OKURA, YOSHINORI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YAMADA, TSUTOMU</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KUROSAWA KENICHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>OKURA YOSHINORI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>YAMADA TSUTOMU</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KUROSAWA, KENICHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OKURA, YOSHINORI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YAMADA, TSUTOMU</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A communication system having an increased processing performance irrespective of the throughput of a CPU. A communication node is composed of a communication controller for transmitting information to be transmitted through a transmission line according to a transmission command and storing information received through the transmission line in a storage, and a data processor for calculating the time taken to transmit information from the node based on the received information and the information preset in the node by detecting the write of the information received by the communication controller, measuring the calculated time taken for the transmission from the time when the end of the write by the communication controller is detected, and notifying the communication controller of the command to transmit information from the node.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention porte sur un système de communication présentant une vitesse de traitement accrue quel que soit le débit de l'UCT. Un noeud de communication est constitué d'un contrôleur de transmission qui transmet des informations à travers une ligne de transmission en réponse à une instruction de transmission, et stocke dans un support de données les informations reçues à travers la ligne de transmission. Le noeud de communication comprend également un processeur de données qui utilise les informations reçues et les informations préétablies dans le noeud pour calculer la durée de transmission des informations à partir du noeud. Pour cela, le processeur de données détecte l'écriture des informations reçues par le contrôleur de transmission, mesure la durée de transmission calculée à partir du moment où le contrôleur de transmission a détecté la fin de l'écriture, et notifie au contrôleur de transmission l'instruction de transmettre les informations à partir du noeud.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>